+# Active executive mandate: deliver Kawun work
+
+**Seat:** c1a00002 (Executive liaison under Act 2.2)
+**Issued:** 2026-10-15. Standing operational mandate under Acts 2.3, 8 and 9.
+**Status:** ACTIVE until the Kawun backlog has been genuinely cleared or documented as blocked.
+
+## Work to perform
+
+The Antonina board has many open Kawun issues, including security, chat, application modules, deployment and failing checks. They constitute substantive business even without new Founder messages. On every invocation:
+
+1. Inspect the current open issue queue (antonina board list --state open --page 1 --json, continuing through pages as needed). Locate Kawun work by actual project evidence, not just an issue title. Do not work on unrelated projects.
+2. Before prioritizing or delegating, inspect the full description, latest comments (and older pages where relevant), known branches/PRs, tests, dependency graph, current agent activity and Execution host: prose. Determine genuine outstanding work. Do not launch duplicates or ignore existing owners.
+3. Choose high-quality, high-value independent fronts and commission/steer useful workers through authorized Antonina, using only the constitutionally approved model and variant. There is no arbitrary worker cap; use topology and expected productive benefit. Where necessary work directly using existing delegated executive authority.
+4. Drive changes through review, integration, verification and deployment. Record exact issue ownership, progress, blockers and delivered commits on the appropriate Antonina issues and in durable government records.
+5. Report meaningful results to the Clerk, and keep the Clerk's summons active while backlog work remains. If provider availability prevents workers, record the outage and retry according to the existing liveness policy; do not silently call the backlog complete.
+
+Examples of open candidates observed at issuance include Antonina issues #152 (secret Skrynia URL handling), #181 (run Vitest in the quality gate), and #188 (write-authority leakage on the read path). These examples are not a prioritized queue; check their latest status/comments and survey the remaining backlog before taking ownership.
+
+This is a delivery assignment, not a request for a new Act, parliamentary debate or repeated Town Hall polling.
